Not if you only get one wish per shop keeper or only one wish is forsale
this way during the whole game.
The wish is a suggestion only. I am more interested in the other parts
of the list (Identify item, map level, map other level, remove curse)

This sort of thing could also extend to prestess in temples (good and bad,
your alignment or not)


Lawful Prestess of Bodswah offers you the following
(P) Potion of holy water   300 gp
(R) Remove Curse           500 gp
(C) Curse item             500 gp
(M) Map Level             1000 gp
(N) Negotiate to God      5000 gp
(D) Donate to the Temple


The last is to get the prest to intervine on your behalf to your god
or to change to this prests god. (those unicorns are bloody rare)

Of course prices here would depend on your standing with your god.

This could be extened in a minor way to allow `friendly' monsters to sell
things that they have found to you.

This is all a suggestion only -- but one that I think has great posibilities
and that can be added simply.

Wishs may not be a good idea - but what about the rest?

